WEBVTT

00:00:01.196 --> 00:00:02.376
<v tim-pritlove>Guten Morgen, Khaleesi.

00:00:03.077 --> 00:00:03.937
<v khaleesi>Guten Morgen, Tim.

00:00:04.418 --> 00:00:06.008
